 arch/x86/include/{ => uapi}/asm/pvclock-abi.h | 27 ++++++++++---------
 scripts/xen-hypercalls.sh                     |  2 +-
 3 files changed, 18 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)
 rename arch/x86/include/{ => uapi}/asm/pvclock-abi.h (82%)

